WEBVTT

00:00:00.273 --> 00:00:02.885
[Po] Yeah, so I'm like,
"Fine, you may be a wolf,
就算你是恶狼

00:00:03.015 --> 00:00:06.105
you may be the scariest bandit
in Haijin Province...
还是超级头目

00:00:06.236 --> 00:00:07.977
...but you're a lousy tipper."
给起小费却超小气的

00:00:08.107 --> 00:00:11.676
Really? So how did you
get out of there alive?
你真的这么说？
那你怎么安然脱身的

00:00:11.807 --> 00:00:14.418
I mean, I didn't
actually say that...
我没真的说出来啦

00:00:14.548 --> 00:00:15.985
...but I thought it...
只是在心里想想而已

00:00:16.115 --> 00:00:17.726
...in my mind.
只是在心里想想而已

00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:19.771
If he could read my mind,
他会读心术的话就惨了

00:00:19.902 --> 00:00:21.251
he'd have been, like, "What?"
他会读心术的话就惨了

00:00:21.381 --> 00:00:25.472
Order up!
Hope you like it.
好吃吗？

00:00:25.603 --> 00:00:28.780
- This is really good!
- No, come on.
真是太美味了！

00:00:28.911 --> 00:00:30.651
Try my dad's
Secret Ingredient Soup.
那你该尝我老爸的祖传秘方煲汤
但那是他的祖传秘方

00:00:30.782 --> 00:00:33.045
He actually knows
the secret ingredient.
那你该尝我老爸的祖传秘方煲汤
但那是他的祖传秘方

00:00:33.176 --> 00:00:35.700
What do you talking about?
This is amazing!
少来 这超好吃的

00:00:35.831 --> 00:00:37.223
[Crane] Wow, you're a good cook.
-哇塞 你厨艺真好
-真希望我嘴巴大一点

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:38.834
[Mantis] I wish
my mouth was bigger.
-哇塞 你厨艺真好
-真希望我嘴巴大一点

00:00:38.964 --> 00:00:40.705
Tigress,
you've got to try this.
虎妞 你非得尝尝

00:00:40.836 --> 00:00:44.187
It is said that the Dragon
Warrior can survive for months
可以滴水不进数月…

00:00:44.317 --> 00:00:49.453
on nothing but the dew of
a single ginkgo leaf and
the energy of the universe.
可以滴水不进数月…

00:00:49.583 --> 00:00:54.545
I guess my body doesn't know
it's the Dragon Warrior yet.
我想我的身体还没感觉到…
自己是神龙大侠吧

00:00:54.675 --> 00:00:59.768
I'm gonna need a lot more
than dew and universe juice.
我需要更多的食物
还有那“天地万物”的汤汁

00:01:01.508 --> 00:01:03.859
[all laughing]
-干嘛？
-没事 你好像师傅

00:01:03.989 --> 00:01:06.731
- What?
- Oh, nothing... Master Shifu.
-干嘛？
-没事 你好像师傅

00:01:06.862 --> 00:01:08.951
[all laughing]

00:01:09.081 --> 00:01:11.518
[imitating Shifu] You'll
never be the Dragon Warrior
你绝对无法成为神龙大侠

00:01:11.649 --> 00:01:14.870
- unless you lose 500 pounds
and brush your teeth!
- [laughter]
除非你减掉两百公斤
还要每天刷牙

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.480
What is that noise
you're making?
你在出什么怪声？
我从来没听过

00:01:16.610 --> 00:01:18.438
Laughter?
I never heard of it!
你在出什么怪声？
我从来没听过

00:01:18.569 --> 00:01:21.528
Work hard, panda,
and maybe someday...
加油 熊猫 也许有一天…

00:01:21.659 --> 00:01:23.617
...you will have ears like mine.
你也会长出像我一样的耳朵

00:01:25.010 --> 00:01:27.186
- That's good.
- [laughter stops]
超像的

00:01:27.317 --> 00:01:30.450
Ears. It's not working for you?
I thought they were pretty good.
耳朵！你觉得不好笑吗？
我倒是觉得很好笑

00:01:30.581 --> 00:01:33.758
- It's Shifu!
- Of course.
What do you think I'm doing?
这当然是师傅
装得不像吗？

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:38.067
Oooh!
Master Shifu!
师傅…

00:01:38.197 --> 00:01:41.244
[laughter]

00:01:41.374 --> 00:01:42.985
[Shifu] You think this is funny?
你把这当儿戏？

00:01:43.115 --> 00:01:45.857
Tai Lung has escaped,
and you're acting like children!
残豹逃出大牢了
你们还在这里胡闹

00:01:45.988 --> 00:01:48.425
- What?
- He is coming
for the Dragon Scroll,
-什么？
-他要来抢走神龙秘笈

00:01:48.555 --> 00:01:50.949
and you are the only one
who can stop him.
而你是唯一能阻止他的人

00:01:53.256 --> 00:01:54.953
[laughing]
And here I am,
哈哈 我还说你没有幽默感

00:01:55.084 --> 00:01:56.955
saying you got
no sense of humor.
哈哈 我还说你没有幽默感

00:01:57.086 --> 00:01:59.262
I'm gonna...
stop Tai Lung.
要我去阻止…

00:01:59.392 --> 00:02:02.134
What? You're serious?
And I have to...?
你没说笑？我必须…

00:02:02.265 --> 00:02:06.269
[stammering] Master Oogway
will stop him, he did before.
…乌龟大师会阻止他
他以前阻止过 现在也行

00:02:06.399 --> 00:02:09.228
- He'll do it again.
- Oogway cannot!
他不行

00:02:09.359 --> 00:02:12.101
- Not anymore.
- [all gasping]
再也不行了

00:02:12.231 --> 00:02:14.668
Our only hope
is the Dragon Warrior.
我们唯一的希望就是…
神龙大侠

00:02:14.799 --> 00:02:16.453
- The panda?
- Yes, the panda!
-熊猫？
-没错 就是熊猫

00:02:16.583 --> 00:02:18.455
Master, let us
stop Tai Lung.
大师 让我们阻止残豹
这就是你训练我们的目的啊

00:02:18.585 --> 00:02:20.196
This is what
you've trained us for.
大师 让我们阻止残豹
这就是你训练我们的目的啊

00:02:20.326 --> 00:02:22.154
No! It is not your destiny
不 打败残豹不是你们的使命

00:02:22.285 --> 00:02:23.808
to defeat Tai Lung.
不 打败残豹不是你们的使命

00:02:23.939 --> 00:02:25.549
It is his!
是他的

00:02:25.679 --> 00:02:26.724
Where'd he go?
他人呢？

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:30.684
[screaming]

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:37.430
You cannot leave!
A real warrior never quits.
你不能逃跑
真正的侠士绝不放弃

00:02:37.561 --> 00:02:39.258
Watch me.
看着吧

00:02:41.739 --> 00:02:44.176
Come on. How am I
supposed to beat Tai Lung?
我怎么可能打败残豹
我连爬阶梯都吃不消

00:02:44.307 --> 00:02:46.483
I can't even
beat you to the stairs.
我怎么可能打败残豹
我连爬阶梯都吃不消

00:02:46.613 --> 00:02:50.530
- You will beat him because
you are the Dragon Warrior.
- Ow!
你会打败他…
因为你是神龙大侠

00:02:50.661 --> 00:02:53.794
You don't believe that. Oh!
You never believed that.
连你也不相信
你从来就不相信

00:02:53.925 --> 00:02:56.841
From the first moment
I got here, you've been
trying to get rid of me.
从我来这里 你就一直想赶我走

00:02:56.972 --> 00:02:59.235
Yes! I was.
对 我当初是这样

00:02:59.365 --> 00:03:01.672
But now I ask you
to trust in your master
不过现在我要你相信你的师傅
就像我自己也开始相信

00:03:01.802 --> 00:03:04.544
as I have come
to trust in mine.
不过现在我要你相信你的师傅
就像我自己也开始相信

00:03:04.675 --> 00:03:09.158
[grunts] You're not my master.
And I'm not the Dragon Warrior.
你才不是我的师傅
我也不是神龙大侠

00:03:09.288 --> 00:03:13.727
Then why didn't you quit?!
You knew I was trying to get
rid of you, yet you stayed.
你知道我一直想赶你走
你却赖着打死不走

00:03:13.858 --> 00:03:15.816
Yeah, I stayed.
没错 我没走…

00:03:15.947 --> 00:03:19.690
I stayed because every time
you threw a brick at my head
我没走 因为…
每次你教训我 侮辱我…

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:24.086
or said I smelled, it hurt,
but it could never hurt more
那的确伤了我的心
但更让人伤心的是

00:03:24.216 --> 00:03:28.351
than it did every day
of my life just being me.
每天浑浑噩噩混日子

00:03:28.481 --> 00:03:32.964
I stayed because I thought,
if anyone could change me...
我没走 因为…
我以为如果有人可以改变我

00:03:33.095 --> 00:03:36.011
...could make me... not me...
能让我…
变得不像自己

00:03:36.141 --> 00:03:37.751
...it was you.
那个人就是你

00:03:37.882 --> 00:03:40.754
The greatest kung fu teacher
in all of China!
全中国最伟大的师傅

00:03:40.885 --> 00:03:42.495
But I can change you!
我可以改变你

00:03:42.626 --> 00:03:46.064
I can turn you into
the Dragon Warrior! And I will!
我可以让你变成神龙大侠
我现在做得到

00:03:46.195 --> 00:03:50.112
Come on. Tai Lung is
on his way here right now.
少来 残豹就要来了！

00:03:50.242 --> 00:03:53.550
Even if it takes him
a hundred years to get here,
how are you...
就算他花一百年才跑到这里
你要怎么做…

00:03:53.680 --> 00:03:58.076
...gonna change this
into the Dragon Warrior, huh?
才能让我这大块呆成为…
神龙大侠？

00:04:00.252 --> 00:04:01.384
How?
你说啊怎么做？

00:04:02.863 --> 00:04:04.039
How?
怎么做？

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:09.261
- How?!
- I don't know!
-怎么做啊？
-我不知道！

00:04:17.139 --> 00:04:18.923
I don't know.
我真的不知道

00:04:25.451 --> 00:04:27.714
That's what I thought.
跟我想的一样

00:05:06.231 --> 00:05:08.581
This is what you trained me for.
这就是我们练武的目的

00:05:15.588 --> 00:05:16.676
[Viper] Tigress!
虎妞

00:05:20.724 --> 00:05:22.682
Don't try and stop me.
别想阻止我

00:05:25.163 --> 00:05:26.773
[Viper] We're not
trying to stop you.
我们不是想阻止你

00:05:26.904 --> 00:05:29.994
- What?
- We're coming with you!
-什么？
-我们要跟你并肩作战

00:05:54.584 --> 00:05:56.151
[Po yells]

00:06:07.553 --> 00:06:09.033
[yells]

00:06:09.860 --> 00:06:12.036
[yelling continues]

00:06:12.167 --> 00:06:14.952
[shouting]

00:06:39.716 --> 00:06:41.326
[burping]

00:06:43.067 --> 00:06:46.679
What? I eat when I'm upset, OK?
干嘛？
我心烦就会狂吃 知道吗？

00:06:47.854 --> 00:06:49.117
Oh. No need to explain.
你不必解释

00:06:49.247 --> 00:06:51.075
I just thought
you might be Monkey.
我以为你是猴王
他都把杏仁饼放在最上面

00:06:51.206 --> 00:06:53.512
He hides his almond cookies
on the top shelf.
我以为你是猴王
他都把杏仁饼放在最上面

00:06:54.644 --> 00:06:55.993
[gasping]

00:06:58.082 --> 00:07:00.084
[dishes clattering]

00:07:14.229 --> 00:07:15.882
Don't tell Monkey.
别向猴王告状

00:07:16.013 --> 00:07:18.972
- Look at you.
- Yeah, I know, I disgust you.
-看看你
-我知道 你觉得我很恶心

00:07:19.103 --> 00:07:22.237
No, I mean,
how did you get up there?
不 我在想你是怎么上去的？

00:07:22.367 --> 00:07:25.283
I don't know. I guess that...
不晓得 我猜…

00:07:25.414 --> 00:07:27.720
I don't know.
I was getting a cookie.
我只是想吃饼干吧

00:07:27.851 --> 00:07:30.462
And yet you are ten feet
off the ground.
但是你却一跳就跳到那么高

00:07:30.593 --> 00:07:32.986
And you have done
a perfect spilt.
而且还会标准的一字功

00:07:33.117 --> 00:07:36.773
No, this? This is just...
这样吗？这只是…

00:07:36.903 --> 00:07:37.948
...an accident.
一个意外

00:07:38.078 --> 00:07:39.906
- [shouts]
- [crashing]
一个意外

00:07:42.474 --> 00:07:45.477
There are no accidents.
世上没有意外

00:07:45.608 --> 00:07:46.826
Come with me.
跟我来

00:07:49.873 --> 00:07:52.789
[Po panting heavily]

00:07:54.704 --> 00:07:57.968
I know you're trying to be
all mystical and kung fuey...
我知道你要教我神奇的功夫

